WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
Act 2.

2
00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.360
Night.

3
00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:06.150
Macbeth is alone, minutes
before he kills the king.

4
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.890
He stares at the air: "Is this
a dagger which I see before me."

5
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.130
He reaches out.

6
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.640
His hand closes on nothing.

7
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.760
Act 3.

8
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:16.830
A feast.

9
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.300
Every stool is filled but one.

10
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.130
Macbeth staggers back from it,
while his guests stare at him.

11
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.440
A dagger, then a ghost.

12
00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.030
Are they really there?

13
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.480
In this mission, you'll pick apart the
questions Macbeth fires at that dagger.

14
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.970
You'll find out why no one else
at the feast reacts to the stool.

15
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.850
And you'll follow blood, water and sleep,

16
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.560
from just after the murder to Act 5.

17
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:43.630
Your mission: decide
whether they are real.
